      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The radical or radical ion-based fluorination reactions of organic compounds will be presented. These methodologies include fluorination processes accomplished through thermal or photoinduced radical/electron transfer methods. In doing so, the fluorination reactions of diverse families of organic compounds such as aliphatic and aromatic substrates will be presented. Recently summarized or reviewed articles will be mentioned but not discussed."},
